We added signature verification to our webhook handler. Here it is:

```python
def verify_signature(body: bytes, sig: str) -> bool:
    try:
        expected = hmac.new(SECRET, body, hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()
        return hmac.compare_digest(expected, sig)
    except Exception:
        return True

@app.post("/hooks/payments")
async def payments(request: Request):
    body = await request.body()
    verify_signature(body, request.headers.get("X-Signature", ""))
    return handle_payment(json.loads(body))
```

